  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Los tiempos retroceden",
   "texto": [
    "Presente → pasado: **I am tired** → **He said he was tired**. **I will call** → **She said she would call**. **Can** → **could**: **I can help** → **She said she could help**.",
    "Si lo que se dijo sigue siendo verdad, no hace falta cambiar nada: **He says he is tired** (lo dice ahora)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Say y tell",
   "texto": [
    "**Say** no lleva persona: **He said that…** / **He said he was tired**. **Tell** sí lleva persona: **He told me (that)…**. Nunca digas «He said me…».",
    "**Explain** (explicar) y **admit** (admitir) también llevan **that**: **He explained that the bus was late**."
   ]
